From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] windows.ui.xaml: a Hyperlink clicked raises Click and opens its NavigateUri

A Hyperlink in a TextBlock was drawn but did nothing when clicked. A press and release on the same Hyperlink now raises its Click handlers and then opens its NavigateUri with the system's handler, as on Windows; the link under the pointer is found by hit-testing the TextBlock's text layout against the parts of its text each Hyperlink formats.
---
diff --git a/dlls/windows.ui.xaml/Makefile.in b/dlls/windows.ui.xaml/Makefile.in
index 691dd30..7688027 100644
--- a/dlls/windows.ui.xaml/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/windows.ui.xaml/Makefile.in
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 MODULE  = windows.ui.xaml.dll
 PARENTSRC = ../windows.applicationmodel
-IMPORTS = combase ole32 xmllite d2d1 dwrite windowscodecs user32 advapi32 uuid
+IMPORTS = combase ole32 xmllite d2d1 dwrite windowscodecs user32 advapi32 shell32 uuid
 
 SOURCES = \
 	accel.c \
